    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9c93b0c59a527f6144d5b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从这里开始，她将孤身一人……\n进入更深、更险峻的山里。\n――为了进一步磨砺内心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1a1cf0a346fd633e791e901ec567372a5e1d1d06e39fd3a55862567beeed74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4dedb6ec925cf7fdd3e919",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我交给勇敢之心一块腕表型的设备。\n这样就能随时掌握她的健康状态，\n必要时也能发送警告。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c4bc2634cd6d1a374ac72e8b2ef752c6847a8adb9d4bab1e6ef35cb1197bfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:023685842b3fd6273e0506f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……对不起，不能陪在你身边",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a50b6500949d48e21e52f9e88c7f7eaae72d2d3392abfc05f6aafc85792e068",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ce19fd45e65524b264343db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入深处的许可虽然批下来了，\n万一有事我也随时准备好能立刻赶过去了……\n即便如此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b1c6154b8207264b32d9050d891a5093029d8a22c5131170369a2d3ea5bcda1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c31d704dc46fb48bcb78b88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
