    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b56ed64881d87b3c316e05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为只要有你在……我就会安下心啊。\n那样的话――可没法磨砺内心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f82a63ba483286dc8d1a9478f22cf71faf4a0af187530322589cb3384a2fcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ef5d5bf868485e63a77e38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。……我会在这里等着你",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6ceee0fc7457c8a3137987de0cc9950eaf84d9af9087860861caeff5629c451",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112104.json",
