    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e30ec1ddfee5284470aedce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇心同学……早已知晓自己的武器是什么。\n接下来要做的，只是去打磨它而已……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a269cf63b05a47ed56f6b013692d886d085c4c21f678f6ebb765026755042f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
