      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，是啊！\n行李必须尽可能轻才对，\n光是在山里移动就够消耗体力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43660563d261e1377b4ddb9bde246dfbad2fe7f8389adeac4e98a9b96f0f9e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
